				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12065376#post-4281087</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12065376/scp-378#post-4281087</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 15 Jun 2019 03:05:15 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>The Great Hippo</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3938622</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm a little surprised this article doesn't have any posts or comments on it!</p> <p>I enjoyed the premise; certainly, I enjoyed it enough to upvote. My only real issues here are with presentation and polish: The email formatting could be cleaner, the description could be a lot shorter, and the final kicker in the last email could be a lot more&#8230; well, &quot;kickier&quot;:</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Example</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p>And that's when we see a different centipede in his head, where our centipede usually goes.</p> <p>More to come, but I have a bad feeling about this.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>And that's when we find a completely <em>different</em> centipede in his head.</p> <p>More to come &#8212; but I've got a bad feeling about this.</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <p>All in all, a nice idea &#8212; my only gripes are that it could be executed tighter.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
